  "local_changes": [
    "Publish x86 commpage pointers after initial writes establish the writable kernel alias, avoiding a timer-interrupt write fault during population.",
    "Distinguish empty/compressed page-table entries from valid physical page zero during ARM pmap removal.",
    "Enable the GIC-400 distributor and CPU interface groups required by QEMU raspi4b without security extensions.",
    "Use physical memory-device copies for the reserved x86_64 EFI RAM disk, outside the kernel static mapping.",
    "Fail entitlement queries closed when the embedded profile has no AMFI provider. Accept entitlement acceleration without AMFI only for ad-hoc signatures with empty entitlements and no privileged flags, platform identity or team identifier. Normal CodeDirectory validation and code-page hash checks remain enabled."
  ],
